      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Yeah, if you know that 35% or more of your clients use something knowing full well they could get banned for it, then maybe these features should be in the base game? The dynamic bones is such a no brainer. Who doesn't love running their hands through someones hair, or petting a cute cat?",
